# Proper closed subsets under base change

The inverse image of a closed subset proper over a base remains proper over the new base after a
base change of schemes. This is
`AlgebraicGeometry.isProperOver_preimage_baseChange`, proved in
`StacksFrontier.AlgebraicGeometry.Morphisms.Proper.ProperClosedSubset` and re-exported here along
with the rest of the properness-over-a-base API.

